<title>ESTONIA: ESTONIA-HANSAPANK HOLDS 23 PCT OF BOURSE TRADE.</title>
<headline>ESTONIA-HANSAPANK HOLDS 23 PCT OF BOURSE TRADE.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hansapank was again the leading broker list on the Estonian bourse in July, the stock exchange said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Hansapank had 36 percent of the bourse turnover and 23 percent of bourse trades, the stock exchange said in a statement.</p>
<p>Hoiupank was second with 19 percent of bourse turnover and 21 percent of bourse trades.</p>
<p>Uhispank held 14 percent of turnover and 14 percent of trades.</p>
<p>-- Tallinn newsroom +372 620 9202 reuters@reuters.ee</p>
</text>
